      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — formatting test cases on separate lines, adding clarifying comments about Unix time boundaries, and making the test body more readable.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version formats each test case on its own line with inline comments explaining the boundary scenario it covers, introduces a named intermediate variable (`unixSeconds`) to make the assertion chain easier to follow, and adds a descriptive `@ParameterizedTest` name pattern — all without changing which methods are called or what outcomes are expected."
